      <Desc>EDUCATION AND OUTREACH - Deliver expert-led workshops, educational panels and symposiUM to provide valuable information on topics of top concern to people affected by a chronic degenerative disease; topics include financial and estate planning, legal issues, Medicare/MediCal, evaluating in-home vs. facility care, evidence-based ways to cope with the diagnosis, and more. Promoted organization by participating in county-wide community educational events. We instituted the creation of a Mental Health program for psy/social workers. Also, held a special initiative for the Hispanic Parkinson's community.</Desc>
