        <Desc>GOOD START AND MENTOR PROGRAMS ARE DESIGNED FOR THOSE INDIVIDUALS AND THEIR CARE PARTNERS WHO HAVE BEEN DIAGNOSED WITH PARKINSON'S. THE GOAL OF THE PROGRAMS - OFFERED AT NO COST TO PARTICIPANTS - IS TO HELP AMELIORATE THE FEAR AND ANXIETY ASSOCIATED WITH A DIAGNOSIS OF PARKINSON'S DISEASE BY PROVIDING ACCURATE INFORMATION AND SUPPORT RESOURCES. 22 SEASONED MENTORS OFFER SUPPORT AND INFORMATION FOR THOSE SEEKING ASSISTANCE WITH THEIR JOURNEY.</Desc>
